## 3️⃣ Slice Length & Capacity

```go
func TestSliceCapacityGrowth(t *testing.T) {
	s := make([]int, 0, 2)

	initialCap := cap(s)
	s = append(s, 1, 2, 3)

	if cap(s) <= initialCap {
		t.Errorf("Expected capacity to grow")
	}
}
```

