## 5️⃣ Clone Slice

```go
func clone(nums []int) []int {
	out := make([]int, len(nums))
	copy(out, nums)
	return out
}

func TestCloneSlice(t *testing.T) {
	original := []int{1, 2, 3}
	copy := clone(original)

	copy[0] = 100

	if original[0] == 100 {
		t.Error("Expected deep copy, but original changed")
	}
}
```

