## 1️⃣9️⃣ Concurrent Map Panic

```go
func TestConcurrentMapPanics(t *testing.T) {
	defer func() {
		recover() // avoid crashing test suite
	}()

	m := make(map[int]int)

	go func() {
		for i := 0; i < 1000; i++ {
			m[i] = i
		}
	}()

	go func() {
		for i := 0; i < 1000; i++ {
			_ = m[i]
		}
	}()
}
```

